'''Rang''' (Lamma) is a clan of Mumuye tribe In Lamma ward Zing local government area of [[Taraba State]], [[Nigeria]]. It is spoken in and around Lamma, and in Zanto Lamma or Zori, Besagba, Koyu, and Jauro Nasaraawo Jereng. Rang is the first clan to settled in Lamma<ref name="Shimuzu">{{Cite book|title=A Comparative Study of the Mumuye Dialects (Nigeria)|last=Shimizu|first=Kiyoshi|publisher=Verlag von Dietrich Reimer|year=1979|series=Marburger Studien zur Afrika- und Asienkunde|volume=A-14|location=Berlin|pages=13–19}}</ref>

